+| Normative curator-spec main | `e41f96387287f5e76604627f9e63662f7d6d86d4` |
+| Harness | Go 1.25.5, tmux 3.6a, Apple sandbox-exec |
+| Native root SHA-256 | `8c9af1ca52b75aaa1e67af6365f1e39dfcc3c56a274d3571270079ef669ac9d0` |
